<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Hyperparameters and Implementation Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the weighting coefficient for <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>RS-CL</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>, we initialize to 1.0 and decayed to 0 using a cosine schedule by maximum training steps, such that representation refinement is emphasized in early training while accurate action prediction becomes the main focus later.
For similarity temperature <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> and soft weight temperature <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, we use 0.2 and 1.0, respectively.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Algorithm</h3>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Training VLA with Robot State-aware Contrastive Loss (RS-CL)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            Observations <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐎</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V}</annotation></semantics></math>, instruction <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{c}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{c}}</annotation></semantics></math>, robot state <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐪</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{q}}</annotation></semantics></math>, ground-truth actions <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{A}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{A}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, hyperparameters <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\lambda,\beta,\tau)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\lambda,\beta,\tau)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            Trained parameters <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta,\phi,\psi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta,\phi,\psi</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each training step <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{h}}\leftarrow f_{\phi}(\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐡</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>VLM</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐎</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{h}}\leftarrow f_{\phi}(\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}}))</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Encode inputs with frozen VLM + adapter
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[{\mathbf{h}},{\mathbf{w}}]\leftarrow f_{\phi}(\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})\oplus{\mathbf{u}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐡</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐰</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>VLM</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐎</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mi>𝐮</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[{\mathbf{h}},{\mathbf{w}}]\leftarrow f_{\phi}(\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})\oplus{\mathbf{u}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Append summarization token
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{z}}\leftarrow g_{\psi}({\mathbf{w}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{z}}\leftarrow g_{\psi}({\mathbf{w}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Project summarization output
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}\leftarrow\texttt{ViewCutoff}({\mathbf{z}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">ViewCutoff</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}\leftarrow\texttt{ViewCutoff}({\mathbf{z}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> View cutoff; Representation-level augmentation
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{FM}}\leftarrow\|D_{\theta}({\mathbf{h}},\mathbf{A}_{t}^{s},{\mathbf{q}})-(\epsilon-\mathbf{A}_{t})\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>FM</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐡</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐪</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐀</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{FM}}\leftarrow\|D_{\theta}({\mathbf{h}},\mathbf{A}_{t}^{s},{\mathbf{q}})-(\epsilon-\mathbf{A}_{t})\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Flow-matching loss
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{ij}\leftarrow\frac{\exp(-\|{\mathbf{q}}_{i}-{\mathbf{q}}_{j}\|_{2}/\beta)}{\sum_{k}\exp(-\|{\mathbf{q}}_{i}-{\mathbf{q}}_{k}\|_{2}/\beta)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">−</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>𝐪</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐪</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">/</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>exp</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">−</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>𝐪</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐪</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">/</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{ij}\leftarrow\frac{\exp(-\|{\mathbf{q}}_{i}-{\mathbf{q}}_{j}\|_{2}/\beta)}{\sum_{k}\exp(-\|{\mathbf{q}}_{i}-{\mathbf{q}}_{k}\|_{2}/\beta)}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Robot state-aware contrastive loss
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}\leftarrow-\sum_{i,j}w_{ij}\log\frac{\exp(\mathrm{sim}({\mathbf{z}}_{i},\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}_{j})/\tau)}{\sum_{k}\exp(\mathrm{sim}({\mathbf{z}}_{i},\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}_{k})/\tau)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>RS-CL</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>sim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msub><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub></mstyle><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>sim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}\leftarrow-\sum_{i,j}w_{ij}\log\frac{\exp(\mathrm{sim}({\mathbf{z}}_{i},\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}_{j})/\tau)}{\sum_{k}\exp(\mathrm{sim}({\mathbf{z}}_{i},\tilde{{\mathbf{z}}}_{k})/\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Contrastive loss
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}\leftarrow\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{FM}}+\lambda\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>FM</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>RS-CL</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}\leftarrow\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{FM}}+\lambda\mathcal{L}_{\textrm{RS-CL}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Final joint objective
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              Update parameters <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta,\phi,\psi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta,\phi,\psi</annotation></semantics></math> via gradient descent

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Implementation Details for From-Scratch VLA Training</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We attach a randomly initialized action decoder to various pre-trained VLMs, with a lightweight adapter module <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\phi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\phi}</annotation></semantics></math> in between.
Following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">GEAR (2025)</a></cite>, we define <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>VLM</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐎</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math> as the hidden representation from layer 12 out of 36 layers for Qwen2.5-VL-3B variants and the GR00T N1.5 backbone.
For Qwen2.5-VL-7B, we extract <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>VLM</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐎</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>V</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{VLM}(\mathbf{O}_{t}^{V},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math> from layer 18 out of 28, which yields higher performance in our layer ablation study on LIBERO (see Table <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Implementation Details for From-Scratch VLA Training ‣ Appendix A Hyperparameters and Implementation Details ‣ Contrastive Representation Regularization for Vision-Language-Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>).
For SigLIP, we instead use the final hidden representation as the condition embedding.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As the action decoder, we adopt a 16-layer DiT with 0.5B parameters.
Empirically, we find that omitting a projection layer to reduce embedding dimensionality before conditioning improves performance (see Table <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Implementation Details for From-Scratch VLA Training ‣ Appendix A Hyperparameters and Implementation Details ‣ Contrastive Representation Regularization for Vision-Language-Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>).
Accordingly, we do not apply such a layer.
Instead, for Qwen2.5-VL-7B variants, we use a larger attention dimension that matches its hidden size <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\textrm{model}}=3584" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3584</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\textrm{model}}=3584</annotation></semantics></math>, while Qwen2.5-VL-3B uses <math id="A1.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\textrm{model}}=2048" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\textrm{model}}=2048</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
